SDL2: a video driver for PowerVR GPUs on the Linux framebuffer

Imagination's EGL with its null window system (libpvrNULL_WSEGL), as the
TrimUI Brick's GE8300 runs it: one display, the framebuffer's size and
format, every window full screen, the EGL surface on native window 0, input
from the Linux input devices. Off unless asked for, with
--enable-video-pvrfb (autotools) or SDL_PVRFB (CMake).

